msgid "KOVAC: \"...is anyone on this channel? This is Dr. Ina Kovac, I left Greycrow two weeks ago. If you're in the clean room, you're safe. Listen carefully.\""
msgstr "柯瓦奇：「……這個頻道有人嗎？我是伊娜．柯瓦奇博士，兩週前離開了灰鴉。如果你在無菌室裡，你是安全的。仔細聽好。」"

