msgid "Greycrow Island, Arctic Ocean - November 2031"
msgstr "北冰洋．灰鴉島——2031 年 11 月"

msgid "New Game"
msgstr "新遊戲"

msgid "Continue"
msgstr "繼續遊戲"

msgid "Quit"
msgstr "離開"

msgid "Language: English"
msgstr "語言：English"

msgid "Language: 中文"
msgstr "語言：中文"

msgid "Hunting rifle"
msgstr "獵槍"

msgid "Bolt-action, scoped. For the bears, the station manual said. Hits like a truck; the whole island hears it."
msgstr "栓動式，附瞄準鏡。站內手冊說是用來防熊的。打中像被卡車撞，整座島都聽得到。"

msgid "Rifle rounds"
msgstr "獵槍子彈"

msgid ".308. Heavy brass in a cardboard box."
msgstr ".308 口徑。紙盒裡沉甸甸的銅彈。"

msgid "Nail gun"
msgstr "釘槍"

msgid "Pneumatic, from the workshop. Weak, but barely a whisper. Nobody comes running."
msgstr "工坊的氣動釘槍。威力不大，但幾乎沒有聲音，不會把別的東西引過來。"

msgid "Nail strip"
msgstr "釘條"

msgid "Collated framing nails. Twelve to a strip."
msgstr "排釘。一條 12 根。"

msgid "Flare gun"
msgstr "信號槍"

msgid "Single shot. Wherever the flare lands, it burns and lights up the dark."
msgstr "單發。信號彈落在哪裡，哪裡就會燃燒、照亮黑暗。"

msgid "Flares"
msgstr "信號彈"

msgid "Signal flares. Red, hot, and very bright."
msgstr "求救用的信號彈。紅色、灼熱、非常亮。"

msgid "Fire axe"
msgstr "消防斧"

msgid "Replaces the knife for your first swing. Splits crates and barricades in one blow."
msgstr "取代小刀的第一下揮砍。木箱、木板一斧就劈開。"

msgid "FILE"
msgstr "檔案"

msgid "Field Files"
msgstr "現場檔案"

msgid "HUMAN"
msgstr "人類"

msgid "WEAPONS"
msgstr "武器"

msgid "Downed: %d"
msgstr "擊倒：%d"

msgid "Found %d/%d"
msgstr "收集 %d/%d"

msgid "Tip: %s"
msgstr "對策：%s"

msgid "Not yet encountered."
msgstr "尚未遭遇。"

msgid "[Up/Down] browse"
msgstr "［上／下］翻閱"

msgid "New field file: %s"
msgstr "新的現場檔案：%s"

msgid "Watcher"
msgstr "值班者"

msgid "Station staff, still in their coveralls. Blind - the frost took the eyes first - but they hear everything, and they still walk the rounds they walked alive."
msgstr "還穿著工作服的站內人員。眼睛最先被霜吃掉，所以看不見；但什麼都聽得到，而且還在走生前巡的那條路線。"

msgid "Sneak behind it. Cold slows it down."
msgstr "從背後潛行過去。寒冷會讓它變慢。"

msgid "Sleeper"
msgstr "凍眠體"

msgid "A host gone dormant. It lies among the real dead and looks exactly like them - except for the faint glint of crystal, now and then."
msgstr "進入休眠的宿主。躺在真正的屍體之間，看起來一模一樣——只有偶爾閃一下的結晶微光不同。"

msgid "Watch the bodies before you walk past. Heat or noise wakes it."
msgstr "經過屍體前先看清楚。熱或聲音會把它弄醒。"

msgid "Chimer"
msgstr "鳴骨者"

msgid "The bone has grown into a resonator. It clicks and listens to the echo, like a bat. Light means nothing to it."
msgstr "骨頭長成了共鳴器。它發出喀喀聲、聽回音，像蝙蝠一樣。光對它沒有意義。"

msgid "Stand still while the click passes over you. It shrieks for help when it finds you."
msgstr "喀喀聲掃過時站著別動。被它發現會尖叫叫同伴來。"

msgid "Crawler"
msgstr "爬行者"

msgid "Bent so far forward it walks on its hands. It lives in the ducts and under the floors, and it feels footsteps through the ground."
msgstr "身體往前彎到用手走路。住在管道裡、地板下，靠地面傳來的震動感覺腳步。"

msgid "No eyes at all. Walk, don't run, and it never knows you were there."
msgstr "完全沒有眼睛。用走的別用跑的，它就永遠不知道你來過。"

msgid "Husk"
msgstr "膨脹者"

msgid "The colony has filled this one up like a balloon. Slow, enormous, and one grab carries a frightening dose of spores."
msgstr "菌落把它撐得像氣球一樣。又慢又巨大，被抓一下就會吸進可怕份量的孢子。"

msgid "Don't trade blows. Burn it, or just walk away."
msgstr "別跟它硬碰硬。燒它，或乾脆繞開。"

msgid "Chorister"
msgstr "詠者"

msgid "The crystals ring its throat like a collar. When it sees you, it sings - and everything nearby comes to listen."
msgstr "結晶像項圈一樣圍著它的喉嚨。看到你時它會開始唱——附近的東西全都會過來聽。"

msgid "Kill it first, and quietly, or the whole floor comes."
msgstr "先安靜地解決它，不然整層樓都會過來。"

msgid "Hound"
msgstr "獵犬"

msgid "One of the station's sled dogs. Fast, and its nose still works. It hunts in the open snow."
msgstr "研究站的雪橇犬之一。很快，鼻子也還靈。在開闊的雪地裡獵食。"

msgid "You can't outrun it. Get indoors and shut a door between you."
msgstr "你跑不贏它。躲進室內，讓一道門隔在你們之間。"

msgid "Tundra Mother"
msgstr "苔原之母"

msgid "A polar bear the colony has made its home. The hangar was hers long before you arrived."
msgstr "被菌落當成家的北極熊。在你來之前，機庫就是它的地盤。"

msgid "Its back is soft where the crystals split."
msgstr "結晶裂開的背部比較軟。"

msgid "The Deep Well"
msgstr "深井"

msgid "What was waiting at the bottom of the drill shaft. Forty thousand years asleep. Awake now."
msgstr "在鑽探井底等著的東西。睡了四萬年。現在醒了。"

msgid "It has to breathe in before it sings."
msgstr "它唱之前得先吸一口氣。"

msgid "Operative"
msgstr "武裝人員"

msgid "Gatekeeper troops, landed to contain the island - and everyone on it. Armed, trained, and they carry radios."
msgstr "守門派的部隊，登島來封鎖這座島——連同島上的每一個人。有武器、受過訓練，而且帶著無線電。"

msgid "Hit one mid-call to cut the radio. If the alert goes up, hide and wait it out."
msgstr "在他通報時打中他就能打斷無線電。警報響了就躲起來等它解除。"

msgid "Survival knife"
msgstr "求生刀"

msgid "Your own. Quiet, always there. From behind, one cut is enough."
msgstr "你自己的刀。安靜、永遠在身上。從背後一刀就夠了。"

msgid "Slash, punch, kick - chain them."
msgstr "刀、拳、踢——連起來用。"

msgid "Station security sidearm. Eight rounds."
msgstr "研究站保全的配槍。8 發。"

msgid "Hold aim to steady it before you fire."
msgstr "按住瞄準等準心收束再開槍。"

msgid "Pump action. Two shells. Ends arguments at close range."
msgstr "泵動式。2 發。近距離一槍解決。"

msgid "Useless past a few steps."
msgstr "幾步之外就沒用了。"

msgid "Scoped, bolt-action. The loudest thing on the island."
msgstr "栓動、附瞄準鏡。全島最大聲的東西。"

msgid "One shot, then move."
msgstr "開一槍，然後換位置。"

msgid "Pneumatic, almost silent. Weak, but nothing comes running."
msgstr "氣動式，幾乎無聲。威力弱，但不會引來任何東西。"

msgid "For picking off strays without an alert."
msgstr "用來不觸發警戒地解決落單的敵人。"

msgid "Sets the landing spot burning and lights the dark."
msgstr "讓落點燃燒，照亮黑暗。"

msgid "Fire it past them to pull them away - or into them."
msgstr "射到牠們後面把牠們引開——或直接射進牠們之間。"

msgid "Heavy, red, reliable. Replaces the knife's first swing."
msgstr "沉、紅、可靠。取代小刀的第一下揮砍。"

msgid "Barricades come down in one blow."
msgstr "木板一斧就劈開。"

msgid "North Harbor"
msgstr "北港"

msgid "Ice Caves"
msgstr "冰洞"

msgid "East Wing"
msgstr "東翼研究區"

msgid "GATE ORDERS (printed, stamped): \"Island is under Accord quarantine. Survivors are to be detained, not evacuated. Specimens take priority over personnel. No aircraft leaves Greycrow without Gate One's word.\""
msgstr "守門命令（列印、蓋章）：「本島依協定實施隔離。倖存者一律扣留，不予撤離。樣本優先於人員。未經守門一號許可，任何飛機不得離開灰鴉島。」"

msgid "NOTE, pinned under the rifle: \"Came down here after the dogs. They weren't dogs anymore. Took the rifle off the rack for bears. Doesn't matter what you shoot - it hears the shot from everywhere. - Ivo\""
msgstr "壓在獵槍下的紙條：「追著狗下來的。牠們已經不是狗了。我拿了架上防熊用的獵槍。打什麼都沒差——槍聲到處都聽得到。——伊佛」"

msgid "LAB LOG, East Wing: \"Sealed the wing on the director's order. Twelve still inside. He says the cold will keep them asleep. He says a lot of things.\""
msgstr "東翼實驗日誌：「依站長命令封閉東翼。裡面還有十二個人。他說寒冷會讓他們一直睡著。他說的話可多了。」"

msgid "MEMO - A. KOVAC (dated before she left): \"It isn't a disease. It's a hibernation strategy that uses us as the burrow. Whoever is paying for this already knows that.\""
msgstr "備忘錄——A．柯瓦奇（日期在她離開之前）：「這不是疾病。這是一種冬眠策略，而我們是它的巢穴。出錢的人早就知道了。」"

msgid "Shen"
msgstr "沈若寧"

msgid "[GATE-1]"
msgstr "［守門一號］"

msgid "[GATE-2]"
msgstr "［守門二號］"

msgid "[%s] skip"
msgstr "［%s］跳過"

msgid "Esc"
msgstr "Esc"

msgid "Supply run seventeen. Drop the crates, refuel, home before dark."
msgstr "第十七趟補給。卸貨、加油、天黑前回去。"

msgid "Nobody answered the landing call. Nobody came out for the crates."
msgstr "降落時沒人回應。也沒有人出來搬貨。"

msgid "North Latitude Station. Thirty-one people work there. Not one light on."
msgstr "北緯站。三十一個人在這裡工作。一盞燈都沒亮。"

msgid "The rotor iced up on the way in. I'm not flying anywhere tonight."
msgstr "進場時旋翼結冰了。今晚哪裡都飛不了。"

msgid "Somebody in there has a radio. Find it."
msgstr "裡面一定有人有無線電。去找。"

msgid "Hello? It's the supply pilot. Your landing pad is buried..."
msgstr "有人嗎？我是補給機的駕駛。你們的停機坪被雪埋了……"

msgid "...That was a person. The eyes are gone. Frost is growing out of the skin."
msgstr "……那曾經是個人。眼睛沒了。霜從皮膚裡長出來。"

msgid "It turned toward my voice - not toward my light."
msgstr "它轉向的是我的聲音——不是我的燈光。"

msgid "Quiet, then. Stay out of its way."
msgstr "那就安靜。別擋到它的路。"

msgid "A clean room. Sealed door, its own air. Nothing followed me in."
msgstr "無菌室。密封門、獨立空調。沒有東西跟進來。"

msgid "And a radio. I can save what I know here - and listen. Somebody might be talking."
msgstr "還有無線電。可以在這裡記下我知道的事——然後聽。也許有人在說話。"

msgid "Something big is breathing in there."
msgstr "裡面有個很大的東西在呼吸。"

msgid "The hangar isn't empty. It's hers."
msgstr "機庫不是空的。是牠的地盤。"

msgid "The antenna tower. If the battery holds, one message reaches the mainland."
msgstr "天線塔。如果電池撐得住，能有一則訊息傳到本土。"

msgid "One message. I'd better be sure who I'm calling."
msgstr "只有一則。最好想清楚要呼叫誰。"

msgid "Four hundred meters, straight down."
msgstr "四百公尺，直直往下。"

msgid "The director's last note said only three words. 'It sings back.'"
msgstr "站長最後的筆記只有一句話：「它會唱回來。」"

msgid "Gate One, Gate Two. Harbor perimeter is set. Nothing leaves this island."
msgstr "守門一號，這裡是二號。港口封鎖線完成。任何東西都別想離開這座島。"

msgid "Copy. Survivors are to be held, not evacuated. Anything that runs, you stop."
msgstr "收到。倖存者一律扣留，不准撤離。會跑的，全部攔下。"

msgid "Soldiers. That isn't a rescue."
msgstr "軍隊。那不是來救援的。"

msgid "Whoever sent them knew exactly what was on this island."
msgstr "派他們來的人，很清楚這座島上有什麼。"

msgid "They carry radios. If one of them calls it in, the whole harbor comes down on me."
msgstr "他們帶著無線電。只要有一個人通報，整個港口都會衝過來。"

msgid "The ice is glowing. The whole cave is full of it."
msgstr "冰在發光。整個洞窟都是。"

msgid "And something down here is moving across the floor. On its hands."
msgstr "而且下面有東西在地上移動。用手爬。"

msgid "The east wing. Biology labs. The doors were sealed from this side."
msgstr "東翼。生物實驗室。門是從這一側封起來的。"

msgid "...Something in there is singing."
msgstr "……裡面有東西在唱歌。"

msgid "If it sees me, everything on this floor will hear it."
msgstr "要是被它看到，整層樓都會聽見。"

msgid "THE LONG NIGHT"
msgstr "長夜"

msgid "WAVE %d"
msgstr "第 %d 波"

msgid "WAVE %d CLEAR - EXTRACTION OPEN"
msgstr "第 %d 波清除——撤離點開啟"

msgid "WAVE %d CLEAR  +%d"
msgstr "第 %d 波清除　+%d"

msgid "GET READY"
msgstr "準備"

msgid "SCORE %d"
msgstr "分數 %d"

msgid "NEXT %d"
msgstr "下一波 %d"

msgid "LEFT %d"
msgstr "剩 %d"

msgid "[EXTRACT]"
msgstr "［可撤離］"

msgid "Extract (keep everything)"
msgstr "撤離（獎勵全部帶走）"

msgid "Run it again"
msgstr "再來一局"

msgid "Survival menu"
msgstr "生存選單"

msgid "Title screen"
msgstr "標題畫面"

msgid "EXTRACTED"
msgstr "撤離成功"

msgid "LOST IN THE NIGHT"
msgstr "消失在長夜裡"

msgid "Rank  %s"
msgstr "評價　%s"

msgid "NEW RECORD"
msgstr "新紀錄"

msgid "Score  %d"
msgstr "分數　%d"

msgid "Waves survived  %d"
msgstr "撐過的波數　%d"

msgid "Kills  %d   (silent %d)"
msgstr "擊倒　%d　（無聲 %d）"

msgid "Best combo  %d"
msgstr "最高連殺　%d"

msgid "Echoes earned  +%d%s"
msgstr "獲得殘響　+%d%s"

msgid "(30% - you did not make it out)"
msgstr "（只拿到 30%——沒能撤離）"

msgid "Echoes total  %d"
msgstr "殘響總計　%d"

msgid "Survival: The Long Night"
msgstr "生存模式：長夜"

msgid "LOADOUT"
msgstr "裝備"

msgid "Your second weapon. The pistol and the knife always come along."
msgstr "第二把武器。手槍和小刀一定會帶著。"

msgid "Begin the night"
msgstr "開始這一夜"

msgid "Survive the waves. Every 5th wave you can extract and keep everything - die, and you keep 30%."
msgstr "撐過一波又一波。每 5 波可以撤離、帶走全部獎勵——死掉的話只剩 30%。"

msgid "Back"
msgstr "返回"

msgid "UNLOCK (echoes)"
msgstr "解鎖（殘響）"

msgid "Locked. Unlock it on the right."
msgstr "尚未解鎖。在右邊用殘響解鎖。"

msgid "Unlocked: %s"
msgstr "已解鎖：%s"

msgid "Already yours."
msgstr "已經擁有。"

msgid "Not enough echoes."
msgstr "殘響不夠。"

msgid "Echoes: %d"
msgstr "殘響：%d"

msgid "(locked)"
msgstr "（未解鎖）"

msgid "Weapon: %s"
msgstr "武器：%s"

msgid "Only static. No saving out here tonight."
msgstr "只有雜訊。今晚沒辦法存檔。"

msgid "Corridors, labs and lockers. Close quarters - nowhere to run far."
msgstr "走廊、實驗室和置物櫃。近距離——沒地方跑遠。"

msgid "Open snow between the huts. Hounds come fast in the open."
msgstr "小屋之間的開闊雪地。獵犬在空曠處來得很快。"

msgid "The docks. Gatekeeper troops join the night - and they carry radios."
msgstr "碼頭。守門派部隊也加入這一夜——而且他們帶著無線電。"

msgid "Shotgun loadout"
msgstr "散彈槍裝備"

msgid "Start survival runs with the shotgun."
msgstr "生存模式開局帶散彈槍。"

msgid "Nail gun loadout"
msgstr "釘槍裝備"

msgid "Start survival runs with the silent nail gun."
msgstr "生存模式開局帶無聲的釘槍。"

msgid "Flare gun loadout"
msgstr "信號槍裝備"

msgid "Start survival runs with the flare gun."
msgstr "生存模式開局帶信號槍。"

msgid "Hunting rifle loadout"
msgstr "獵槍裝備"

msgid "Start survival runs with the rifle."
msgstr "生存模式開局帶獵槍。"

msgid "Carry the fire axe in every survival run."
msgstr "每一局生存模式都帶著消防斧。"

msgid "Extra first aid"
msgstr "額外急救包"

msgid "One more first aid kit at the start of each run."
msgstr "每一局開始多一個急救包。"

msgid "Map: North Harbor"
msgstr "地圖：北港"

msgid "Unlock the harbor map, with Gatekeeper troops."
msgstr "解鎖北港地圖（有守門派部隊）。"

msgid "Story cache I"
msgstr "主線補給箱 I"

msgid "New story games: a first aid kit and pistol rounds wait in the safe room box."
msgstr "主線新遊戲時，安全屋的儲物箱裡會有急救包和手槍子彈。"

msgid "Story cache II"
msgstr "主線補給箱 II"

msgid "New story games: a nail gun and nails wait in the safe room box."
msgstr "主線新遊戲時，安全屋的儲物箱裡會有釘槍和釘條。"

msgid "[owned] "
msgstr "［已有］"

msgid "[KOVAC]"
msgstr "［柯瓦奇］"

msgid "...anyone at North Latitude? This is Ana Kovac, on the mainland relay. Is anyone still alive up there?"
msgstr "……北緯站還有人嗎？我是艾娜．柯瓦奇，在本土的中繼站。那邊還有人活著嗎？"

msgid "Supply pilot. Shen Ruoning. Your station is full of people who aren't people anymore."
msgstr "補給駕駛，沈若寧。你們的研究站裡都是……已經不是人的人。"

msgid "Then listen carefully. They can't see you. They hear everything. Stay quiet, stay cold - and stay away from the drill shaft."
msgstr "那就仔細聽好。它們看不見你，但什麼都聽得到。保持安靜、待在冷的地方——還有，離鑽探井遠一點。"

msgid "Dodge"
msgstr "閃躲"

msgid "Item (hold: choose)"
msgstr "道具（按住選擇）"

msgid "Weapon (hold: choose)"
msgstr "武器（按住選擇）"

msgid "GEAR"
msgstr "裝備"

msgid "Gear"
msgstr "裝備"

msgid "HEAD"
msgstr "頭"

msgid "BODY"
msgstr "身"

msgid "FEET"
msgstr "腳"

msgid "(nothing)"
msgstr "（無）"

msgid "Set: %s - %s"
msgstr "套裝：%s——%s"

msgid "[%s] wear"
msgstr "［%s］穿上"

msgid "  (you are here)"
msgstr "（目前位置）"

msgid "Up/Down"
msgstr "上／下"

msgid "Floor map"
msgstr "有地圖"

msgid "No map - explored only"
msgstr "沒有地圖——只顯示去過的地方"

msgid "Damage"
msgstr "受傷"

msgid "Speed"
msgstr "速度"

msgid "Noise"
msgstr "腳步聲"

msgid "Visibility"
msgstr "被發現"

msgid "Kick"
msgstr "踢擊"

msgid "Got %s. Wear it from the phone (GEAR)."
msgstr "取得%s。在手機的「裝備」換穿。"

msgid "Take the floor map"
msgstr "拿走樓層地圖"

msgid "Map of %s added to your phone."
msgstr "%s的地圖已加入手機。"

msgid "Open the safe"
msgstr "打開保險箱"

msgid "A blue star marks the spot on your phone map."
msgstr "手機地圖上那個位置出現了藍色星號。"

msgid "Expedition parka"
msgstr "探險外套"

msgid "Your own orange parka. Warm enough, bright enough to be seen."
msgstr "你自己的橘色外套。夠暖，也夠顯眼。"

msgid "Hazmat suit"
msgstr "防護衣"

msgid "EOD armor"
msgstr "防爆裝甲"

msgid "Bomb disposal armor from the Gatekeeper stores. Shrugs off claws and bullets. Heavy."
msgstr "守門派倉庫裡的防爆裝甲。爪子和子彈都擋得住。很重。"

msgid "Sneaking suit"
msgstr "潛行服"

msgid "Dark, close-fitting, quiet. Not made for the Arctic."
msgstr "深色、貼身、安靜。不是為北極設計的。"

msgid "Arctic suit"
msgstr "極地套裝"

msgid "Insulated white over-suit. The wind barely gets in."
msgstr "白色的保暖外罩。風幾乎吹不進來。"

msgid "Wool hat"
msgstr "毛帽"

msgid "Hand-knitted. Smells of diesel."
msgstr "手織的，有柴油味。"

msgid "Gas mask"
msgstr "防毒面罩"

msgid "Filter hood. Your breathing gets loud in your own ears."
msgstr "附濾罐的頭罩。自己的呼吸聲變得好大。"

msgid "EOD helmet"
msgstr "防爆頭盔"

msgid "Armored helmet with a blast visor."
msgstr "附防爆面罩的裝甲頭盔。"

msgid "Balaclava"
msgstr "黑色面罩"

msgid "Black knit mask. One less pale thing in the dark."
msgstr "黑色針織面罩。黑暗中少一樣會反光的東西。"

msgid "Snow goggles"
msgstr "雪地護目鏡"

msgid "Tinted goggles and a face strap. Keeps the blizzard out of your eyes."
msgstr "有色護目鏡加護臉帶。暴風雪吹不進眼睛。"

msgid "Snow boots"
msgstr "雪靴"

msgid "Ordinary insulated boots."
msgstr "普通的保暖靴。"

msgid "Hazmat boots"
msgstr "防護靴"

msgid "Sealed rubber overboots."
msgstr "密封的橡膠套靴。"

msgid "EOD boots"
msgstr "防爆靴"

msgid "Steel-shanked. Your kicks land like a hammer."
msgstr "鋼製鞋墊。踢起來像鐵鎚。"

msgid "Soft soles"
msgstr "軟底鞋"

msgid "Felt-soled slippers over your socks. Silent - and cold."
msgstr "套在襪子外的毛氈軟鞋。無聲——也很冷。"

msgid "Crampon boots"
msgstr "冰爪靴"

msgid "Spiked boots for ice. Sure footing on the snow."
msgstr "有鞋釘的冰上靴。在雪地站得很穩。"

msgid "Hazmat set"
msgstr "防護套裝"

msgid "EOD set"
msgstr "防爆套裝"

msgid "Full armor: knockback barely moves you."
msgstr "全身裝甲：幾乎不會被擊退。"

msgid "Sneaking set"
msgstr "潛行套裝"

msgid "Full set: quieter still, harder to spot."
msgstr "整套：更安靜、更難被發現。"

msgid "Arctic set"
msgstr "極地套裝組"

msgid "Full set: the cold barely reaches you."
msgstr "整套：寒冷幾乎碰不到你。"

msgid "SAFE (maintenance office): a hunter's ledger. \"Left spare .308 and two flares in the ice caves, east end, below the glowing wall. In case.\""
msgstr "保險箱（維修辦公室）：一本獵人的帳簿。「在冰洞東邊、發光的冰牆下面留了備用的 .308 子彈和兩發信號彈。以防萬一。」"

msgid "SAFE (harbor office): Gatekeeper supply note. \"Medical cache stashed at the fuel depot, northwest corner of the yard, under the tarp.\""
msgstr "保險箱（港口辦公室）：守門派的補給紀錄。「醫療物資藏在燃料庫，廣場西北角的防水布底下。」"

msgid "Gate One - Yard"
msgstr "守門一號・廣場"

msgid "Gate One"
msgstr "守門一號"

msgid "Gate One - Ready Room (Safe)"
msgstr "守門一號・待命室（安全屋）"

msgid "Gate One - Gatekeeper forward base"
msgstr "守門一號——守門派前進基地"

msgid "All posts, Gate One. Ice tunnel is unwatched since the dogs went bad. Double the yard."
msgstr "各崗哨，這裡是守門一號。狗變異之後冰洞隧道就沒人看守了。廣場加倍人手。"

msgid "Their headquarters. Fences, trucks, a gatehouse - and somewhere inside, whoever gives the orders."
msgstr "他們的指揮部。圍牆、卡車、崗哨——裡面某處，就是下命令的人。"

msgid "If anyone on this island knows what's really going on, it's in there."
msgstr "如果這座島上有人知道到底發生了什麼事，答案就在裡面。"

msgid "Barracks, an armory, holding cells. They built a whole base in a month."
msgstr "寢室、軍械庫、拘留牢房。他們一個月就蓋出一整座基地。"

msgid "...and a lab. With the same thing in it as the station."
msgstr "……還有實驗室。裡面的東西跟研究站的一樣。"

msgid "They weren't containing it. They were collecting it."
msgstr "他們不是在圍堵它。他們是在收集它。"

msgid "GATEHOUSE DUTY LOG: \"Day 6. Two more from the station walked up to the wire. Unarmed. Orders were clear. Day 7. Nobody wants the gate shift anymore.\""
msgstr "崗哨值勤日誌：「第六天。又有兩個研究站的人走到鐵絲網前。沒帶武器。命令很清楚。第七天。已經沒人想值大門的班了。」"

msgid "SAFE (commander's office): a quartermaster's chit. \"Two crates held back from the manifest - medical and .308 - buried in the yard by the motor pool, southeast corner. Don't tell Gate Two.\""
msgstr "保險箱（指揮官辦公室）：一張軍需官的字條。「有兩箱沒登記在清單上——醫療用品和 .308 子彈——埋在廣場東南角、車庫旁邊。別讓守門二號知道。」"

msgid "OPERATIONS BOARD: \"Priority one: recover the drill core intact. Priority two: recover live specimens. Priority three: personnel. Strike priority three if it slows one or two.\""
msgstr "作戰白板：「第一優先：完整回收鑽探岩芯。第二優先：回收活體樣本。第三優先：人員。如果第三項拖慢前兩項，劃掉第三項。」"

msgid "UNSENT LETTER, commander's desk: \"They told us it was a chemical spill. Then they told us to keep the infected alive. Then they told us the infected were the cargo. I have stopped asking what we are guarding.\""
msgstr "指揮官桌上沒寄出的信：「他們說是化學外洩。然後要我們讓感染者活著。然後又說感染者就是貨物。我已經不再問我們到底在守什麼了。」"

msgid "COMMS LOG: \"Mainland asks for a head count every six hours. Station survivors: not counted. Specimens: four live, crated. Aircraft: one, grounded by ice. The supply pilot's helicopter.\""
msgstr "通訊紀錄：「本土每六小時要一次人數回報。研究站倖存者：不計。樣本：活體四個，已裝箱。飛機：一架，結冰停飛。是那個補給飛行員的直升機。」"

msgid "SCRATCHED INTO THE CELL WALL: \"I'm not sick. I told them I'm not sick. They took blood every day and they never told me the results. If you read this - they're afraid of the cold room. Ask why.\""
msgstr "刻在牢房牆上的字：「我沒生病。我跟他們說了我沒生病。他們每天抽血，從來不告訴我結果。如果你看到這個——他們很怕冷藏室。問問為什麼。」"

msgid "SPECIMEN REPORT S-4: \"Subject keeps singing at the same pitch as the core sample. When the two are in the same room, both grow. Recommend they are never shipped together.\""
msgstr "樣本報告 S-4：「受試體一直用和岩芯樣本相同的音高在唱。兩者在同一個房間時，都會生長。建議絕對不要一起運送。」"

msgid "The echoes slow down in the cold. Shut off the lounge heating from the lab breaker."
msgstr "回聲體在寒冷中會變慢。用實驗室的配電箱關掉交誼廳的暖氣。"

msgid "LANTERN, 1962"
msgstr "燈籠站，1962"

msgid "A reel-to-reel recorder sits in the B1 maintenance office. Play it, and find the last reel in the 1962 recording room."
msgstr "B1 的維修辦公室裡有一台盤式錄音機。播放它，然後在 1962 年的錄音室找到最後一捲帶子。"

msgid "KOVAC: \"The basement was a Cold War listening post before it was a station. LANTERN. If any of their reels survived, play one. I need to know what they heard in 1962.\""
msgstr "柯瓦奇：「地下室在變成研究站之前，是冷戰時期的監聽站，代號『燈籠』。如果他們的帶子還有留下來的，放一捲來聽。我需要知道他們在 1962 年聽到了什麼。」"

msgid "Damper shot"
msgstr "抑頻針"

msgid "Experimental. Floods the ear nerves with white noise and pushes the static back."
msgstr "實驗品。用白噪音灌滿聽覺神經，把雜訊壓回去。"

msgid "DESK NOTE (Halvorsen): \"Ark line, 125.70, scheduled windows only. They promised a pickup for the reels and the core. Not for us.\""
msgstr "桌上的便條（哈爾沃森）：「方舟專線，125.70，只在排定的時段。他們答應來接錄音帶和岩芯。不是來接我們。」"

msgid "HALVORSEN'S RECORDS: \"Day 3: Mendez and Lund show the clicking. Kept off the report - the Ark people paid for this season. Day 6: moved the ones who kept listening to cold storage - the cold slows the signal. Day 9: power cut. God help us.\""
msgstr "哈爾沃森的紀錄：「第三天：曼德茲和倫德開始發出喀喀聲。沒寫進報告——這一季的經費是方舟的人出的。第六天：把一直在聽的那些人移到冷藏室——低溫會讓訊號變慢。第九天：停電了。願上帝幫助我們。」"

msgid "GATE ORDERS (printed, stamped): \"Island is under Accord quarantine. Survivors are to be detained, not evacuated. Receivers take priority over personnel. No aircraft leaves Greycrow without Gate One's word.\""
msgstr "大門命令（印刷、蓋章）：「本島由協定實施隔離。倖存者一律拘留，不得撤離。接收體優先於人員。沒有守門一號的命令，任何飛機都不准離開灰鴉島。」"

msgid "OPERATIONS BOARD: \"Priority one: recover the drill core intact. Priority two: recover live receivers. Priority three: personnel. Strike priority three if it slows one or two.\""
msgstr "作戰白板：「第一優先：完整回收鑽探岩芯。第二優先：回收活的接收體。第三優先：人員。如果第三項拖慢前兩項，劃掉第三項。」"

msgid "UNSENT LETTER, commander's desk: \"They told us it was a chemical spill. Then they told us to keep the overwritten alive. Then they told us the overwritten were the cargo. I have stopped asking what we are guarding.\""
msgstr "指揮官桌上沒寄出的信：「他們說是化學外洩。然後要我們讓被覆寫的人活著。然後又說被覆寫的人就是貨物。我已經不再問我們到底在守什麼了。」"

msgid "COMMS LOG: \"Mainland asks for a head count every six hours. Station survivors: not counted. Receivers: four live, crated, ears taped. Aircraft: one, grounded by ice. The supply pilot's helicopter.\""
msgstr "通訊紀錄：「本土每六小時要一次人數回報。研究站倖存者：不計。接收體：活的四個，已裝箱，耳朵貼上膠帶。飛機：一架，結冰停飛。是那個補給飛行員的直升機。」"

msgid "RECEIVER REPORT S-4: \"Subject keeps singing at 126.05, the same pitch as the core. When the two are in the same room, both get louder. Recommend they are never shipped together.\""
msgstr "接收體報告 S-4：「受試體一直在 126.05 唱歌，和岩芯是同一個音高。兩者在同一個房間時，聲音都會變大。建議絕對不要一起運送。」"

msgid "LANTERN Listening Post - 1962"
msgstr "燈籠監聽站——1962"

msgid "LANTERN LOG, 14 MARCH 1962: \"Carrier on 126.05 again, from under the ice. Tonight it read us tomorrow's weather. It was right. Then it read a list of names. None of them are born yet.\""
msgstr "燈籠站日誌，1962 年 3 月 14 日：「126.05 又出現載波，從冰層底下傳來。今晚它念了明天的天氣給我們聽。它說對了。然後它念了一串名字。那些人都還沒出生。」"

msgid "ORDER, MAJOR IWASE: \"Effective immediately: the 126.05 recordings do not exist. Reels to be sealed and shipped to Geneva. Personnel who listened will be transferred. Do not discuss the music.\""
msgstr "命令，岩瀨少校：「即刻生效：126.05 的錄音不存在。所有帶子封存，運往日內瓦。聽過的人員一律調離。不准討論那段音樂。」"

msgid "LETTER, CORPORAL SATO (unsent): \"Mika - they're burying the reels. I kept one. If this station is still standing when you're grown, there is a med kit in the maintenance room, under the reel table. I don't know why I'm telling a child that. The signal told me to.\""
msgstr "佐藤下士的信（沒寄出）：「美佳——他們要把帶子埋掉。我偷留了一捲。如果妳長大的時候這座站還在，維修室的錄音機桌底下有一個急救包。我不知道為什麼要跟一個小孩說這個。是訊號叫我說的。」"

msgid "[125.70] ...ARK RELAY. WINDOW OPEN. Greycrow, report reel count."
msgstr "[125.70] ……方舟中繼。時段開放。灰鴉島，回報錄音帶數量。"

msgid "The Choir"
msgstr "合唱"

msgid "[126.05] ...hold position. do not transmit. we will come to you. we always come to you."
msgstr "[126.05] ……原地等待。不要發訊。我們會去接你。我們一直都會去接你。"

msgid "Under the voice, faint: a dance song nobody has written yet, and the traffic of a city. Your watch says 2026. The song says 2099."
msgstr "聲音底下，很微弱：一首還沒有人寫出來的舞曲，和一座城市的車聲。你的手錶寫著 2026。那首歌寫著 2099。"

msgid "You never learn who sent it. Some nights, between stations, your radio plays music from a city that doesn't exist yet."
msgstr "你始終不知道是誰派它來的。有些夜裡，收音機在兩個電台之間，會播出一座還不存在的城市的音樂。"

msgid "2099. The city at the end of the century sings with one voice - a little quieter than it should. It is still waiting for you."
msgstr "2099 年。世紀末的那座城市用同一個聲音歌唱——比它該有的安靜一點。它還在等你。"

msgid "They take the survivors, the logs, the sealed reel cases. Nobody opens the reel cases."
msgstr "他們帶走了倖存者、紀錄，還有封好的錄音帶箱。沒有人打開那些錄音帶箱。"

msgid "Somewhere over the sea, behind the cargo net, a tape machine starts turning on its own."
msgstr "海上某處，貨網後面，一台錄音機自己開始轉了起來。"

msgid "2099. The city sings with one voice, and every child learns the name of the pilot who brought the song home."
msgstr "2099 年。那座城市用同一個聲音歌唱，每個孩子都學過那個把歌帶回家的飛行員的名字。"

msgid "From the sea, the rescue crew will report a single bright light on Greycrow. Then, on every frequency, silence."
msgstr "海上的救援人員會回報：灰鴉島上有一道很亮的光。然後，每個頻率都安靜了。"

msgid "2099. Nobody builds the city. On 126.05 there is nothing but snow - and once a year, very faintly, a reel-to-reel running out."
msgstr "2099 年。沒有人建起那座城市。126.05 上只剩下雪花雜訊——還有每年一次，很微弱地，一捲盤式錄音帶轉到盡頭的聲音。"

msgid "[OUT] GREYCROW TO ANY STATION. HOSTILE SIGNAL. QUARANTINE THE ISLAND. DO NOT LAND. NOBODY LEAVES."
msgstr "[發送] 灰鴉島呼叫任何電台。敵對訊號。隔離本島。不要降落。任何人都不准離開。"

msgid "That wasn't the rescue centre. That was the voice from the 1962 reel. Below the station, the drill shaft is humming."
msgstr "那不是救援中心。那是 1962 年那捲帶子裡的聲音。研究站底下，鑽探井在嗡嗡作響。"

msgid "LANTERN Listening Post - March 1962"
msgstr "燈籠監聽站——1962 年 3 月"

msgid "[SATO]"
msgstr "[佐藤]"

msgid "Carrier on one-two-six-oh-five. Again. It's coming from under the ice."
msgstr "一二六點零五，又出現載波了。是從冰層底下傳來的。"

msgid "It isn't Morse, Major. It's music. And under the music... a city."
msgstr "少校，這不是摩斯電碼。是音樂。音樂底下……是一座城市。"

msgid "[THE CHOIR]"
msgstr "[合唱]"

msgid "...hold position. we will come to you. we always come to you..."
msgstr "……原地等待。我們會去接你。我們一直都會去接你……"

msgid "It just said my name."
msgstr "它剛剛叫了我的名字。"

msgid "Sixty-four years later"
msgstr "六十四年後"

msgid "Greycrow Island, Arctic Ocean - November 2026"
msgstr "北冰洋．灰鴉島——2026 年 11 月"

msgid "...That was a person. The eyes are glass. Something under the skin is clicking, like a radio between stations."
msgstr "……那是一個人。眼睛變成了玻璃。皮膚底下有東西在喀喀作響，像收音機卡在兩個電台之間。"

msgid "Then listen carefully. They aren't sick - they're tuned. They hear everything. Stay quiet, stay cold - and stay away from the drill shaft."
msgstr "那就仔細聽好。他們不是生病——是被調頻了。他們什麼都聽得到。保持安靜、待在冷的地方——還有，離鑽探井遠一點。"

msgid "The east wing. Signal labs. The doors were sealed from this side."
msgstr "東翼。訊號實驗室。門是從這一側封起來的。"

msgid "A reel-to-reel recorder. Older than the station. The label says LANTERN, 15-III-1962."
msgstr "一台盤式錄音機。比這座研究站還老。標籤寫著：燈籠，1962 年 3 月 15 日。"

msgid "The tape is warm. It shouldn't be warm."
msgstr "帶子是溫的。它不應該是溫的。"

msgid "The hiss fills the room - and the room changes around it."
msgstr "沙沙聲充滿了整個房間——房間在聲音裡變了樣子。"

msgid "LANTERN Listening Post - 15 March 1962, 02:40"
msgstr "燈籠監聽站——1962 年 3 月 15 日，凌晨 2:40"

msgid "This is the basement. Sixty-four years ago. I can smell the cigarettes."
msgstr "這裡是地下室。六十四年前的地下室。我聞得到菸味。"

msgid "The signal kept everything that ever listened to it. Including this night."
msgstr "那個訊號留下了所有聽過它的東西。包括這一夜。"

msgid "Soldiers. If they see me, the memory starts over. The recording room is at the far end - ON AIR."
msgstr "士兵。如果被他們看到，這段記憶就會從頭開始。錄音室在最裡面——亮著 ON AIR 的那間。"

msgid "Recording room - 03:12"
msgstr "錄音室——凌晨 3:12"

msgid "Last reel. If the Major finds this one, it goes to Geneva with the rest."
msgstr "最後一捲。如果少校找到這一捲，它也會跟其他的一起送去日內瓦。"

msgid "Whoever is playing this: it isn't a disease. It's a broadcast. It changes whoever listens long enough."
msgstr "不管是誰在聽這捲帶子：這不是疾病。這是一段廣播。聽得夠久的人，都會被它改變。"

msgid "126.05 MHz - origin: 2099"
msgstr "126.05 MHz——來源：2099 年"

msgid "we are the city at the end of your century. one voice. no cold, no dark, no alone."
msgstr "我們是你們這個世紀盡頭的城市。同一個聲音。沒有寒冷，沒有黑暗，沒有孤單。"

msgid "we are sending ourselves back so that you will build us. thank you for listening."
msgstr "我們把自己送回過去，好讓你們把我們建出來。謝謝你們收聽。"

msgid "The Accord is meeting on the twentieth. They'll bury it under the ice and call it a weather station."
msgstr "協定二十號要開會。他們會把它埋在冰底下，然後叫它氣象站。"

msgid "I hid supplies in the maintenance room. For whoever comes next. It said someone would."
msgstr "我把補給藏在維修室了。留給下一個來的人。它說會有人來。"

msgid "The reel runs out. Sixty-four years, and it's the same voice on the same frequency."
msgstr "帶子轉完了。六十四年，同一個頻率，同一個聲音。"

msgid "...and a lab. Antennas, speakers, people strapped to chairs. Same frequency as the station."
msgstr "……還有實驗室。天線、喇叭、綁在椅子上的人。跟研究站是同一個頻率。"

msgid "They weren't jamming it. They were recording it."
msgstr "他們不是在干擾它。他們是在錄它。"

msgid "Station staff, still in their coveralls. The signal overwrote them a little at a time. The eyes went to glass first, but they hear everything, and they still walk the rounds they walked alive."
msgstr "研究站的員工，還穿著工作服。訊號一點一點覆寫了他們。眼睛最先變成玻璃，但他們什麼都聽得到，而且還在走生前每天走的巡邏路線。"

msgid "An echo between broadcasts. It lies among the real dead and looks exactly like them - except for a faint glint of glass, now and then, when the carrier comes back."
msgstr "兩段廣播之間的回聲。它躺在真正的死者之間，看起來和他們一模一樣——只是載波回來的時候，偶爾會閃過一點玻璃的反光。"

msgid "The skull has been retuned into a receiver. It clicks and listens to the echo, like a bat. Light means nothing to it."
msgstr "頭骨被重新調成了一具接收器。它發出喀喀聲，聽回音，像蝙蝠一樣。光對它毫無意義。"

msgid "This one listened for too long. It is swollen with static, slow and enormous, and one grab pours the signal straight into you."
msgstr "這個聽得太久了。它被雜訊撐得腫脹，又慢又巨大，被它抓到一下，訊號就直接灌進你身體裡。"

msgid "Glass rings its throat like a collar. When it sees you, it sings the carrier - and everything nearby comes to listen."
msgstr "玻璃像項圈一樣環著它的喉嚨。它看到你就會唱出載波——附近所有東西都會過來聽。"

msgid "One of the station's sled dogs. Dogs hear higher than we do; it heard the signal first. Fast, and its nose still works."
msgstr "研究站的雪橇犬之一。狗聽得到比人更高的頻率，所以牠最先聽到了訊號。很快，鼻子也還很靈。"

msgid "A polar bear that slept on the hangar roof, right under the antenna. The hangar was hers long before you arrived."
msgstr "一頭睡在機庫屋頂、就在天線正下方的北極熊。早在你來之前，機庫就是她的了。"

msgid "Its back is soft where the glass splits."
msgstr "玻璃裂開的地方，背部很軟。"

msgid "The receiver at the bottom of the drill shaft. Sixty-four years of a future city singing into the ice, grown into one throat."
msgstr "鑽探井底的接收器。一座未來的城市對著冰層唱了六十四年，長成了一個喉嚨。"

msgid "Gatekeeper troops of the Quiet Accord, landed to contain the island - and everyone on it. Armed, trained, and they carry radios."
msgstr "靜默協定的守門派部隊，登島來隔離這座島——連同島上的每一個人。有武器、受過訓練，而且帶著無線電。"

msgid "Static: %s"
msgstr "雜訊：%s"

msgid "  (overwritten)"
msgstr "　（已被覆寫）"

msgid "ECHOES"
msgstr "回聲體"

msgid "The air here is crawling with static. Without a shielded suit, the signal is getting into you."
msgstr "這裡的空氣滿是雜訊。沒穿屏蔽衣，訊號正在鑽進你的身體。"

msgid "Copper-mesh Faraday suit. Keeps the signal haze off you. Crinkles when you move."
msgstr "銅網法拉第衣。訊號霧碰不到你，但一動就沙沙作響。"

msgid "Full shielding: the signal haze can't touch you."
msgstr "完全屏蔽：訊號霧碰不到你。"

msgid "Signal"
msgstr "訊號"

msgid "Play the reel"
msgstr "播放錄音帶"

msgid "Play the 1962 reel"
msgstr "播放 1962 年的錄音帶"

msgid "Play the last reel"
msgstr "播放最後一捲帶子"

msgid "Options"
msgstr "選項"

msgid "OPTIONS"
msgstr "選項"

msgid "On"
msgstr "開"

msgid "Off"
msgstr "關"

msgid "Music: %d%%"
msgstr "音樂：%d%%"

msgid "Sound effects: %d%%"
msgstr "音效：%d%%"

msgid "Sound cues on screen: %s"
msgstr "畫面聲音提示：%s"

msgid "Assist mode (half damage): %s"
msgstr "輔助模式（受傷減半）：%s"

msgid "Touch buttons: %d%%"
msgstr "觸控按鈕：%d%%"

msgid "Left-handed touch: %s"
msgstr "左手觸控：%s"

msgid "Battery saver (30 FPS): %s"
msgstr "省電模式（30 FPS）：%s"

msgid "1962 / 2026 / 2099 - same frequency"
msgstr "1962／2026／2099——同一個頻率"

msgid "Infection: %s"
msgstr "感染：%s"

msgid "  (infected)"
msgstr "　（已感染）"

msgid "INFECTED"
msgstr "感染體"

msgid "Spores hang in the air here. Without a sealed suit, you're breathing them in."
msgstr "這裡的空氣裡飄著孢子。沒穿密封的防護衣，你正在把它們吸進去。"

msgid "Spores"
msgstr "孢子"

msgid "Sealed biohazard suit. Keeps the spores out. Crinkles when you move."
msgstr "密封的生化防護衣。孢子進不來，但一動就沙沙作響。"

msgid "Full seal: spores can't touch you."
msgstr "完全密封：孢子碰不到你。"

msgid "Whoever is playing this: the thing in the ice is alive. It sings on this frequency - and the song is coming from the future."
msgstr "不管是誰在聽這捲帶子：冰裡的東西是活的。它在這個頻率上唱歌——而那首歌，是從未來傳來的。"

msgid "The colony in the ice sings - and its song kept everything that ever heard it. Including this night."
msgstr "冰裡的菌落會唱歌——它的歌留下了所有聽過它的東西。包括這一夜。"

msgid "Soldiers. If they see me, the memory starts over. The recording room is at the far end of the post."
msgstr "士兵。如果被他們看到，這段記憶就會從頭開始。錄音室在監聽站的最裡面。"

msgid "Runner"
msgstr "狂奔者"

msgid "Infected only days ago. The frost hasn't slowed it yet - it still runs like the athlete it was, and it hears your heartbeat in the corridor."
msgstr "幾天前才被感染。寒冷還沒讓它慢下來——它跑起來還像生前那個運動員，而且聽得到你在走廊上的心跳。"

msgid "Fragile. Two good hits. Don't let it get a straight line to you."
msgstr "很脆，打中兩下就倒。別讓它有一條直線衝向你。"

msgid "Spitter"
msgstr "噴孢者"

msgid "Its throat has swollen into a spore sac. It hangs back and spits clots of colony at anything that moves."
msgstr "喉嚨腫成了一個孢子囊。它躲在後面，對任何會動的東西吐出一團團菌落。"

msgid "Close the distance or break line of sight. The glob arcs - sidestep it."
msgstr "拉近距離，或躲到它看不到的地方。孢子團是拋物線飛的——往旁邊閃。"

msgid "Rimebrute"
msgstr "冰甲巨人"

msgid "The colony mineralised this one's bones into a breastplate of ice. Bullets skip off the front. The back is still flesh."
msgstr "菌落把它的骨頭礦化成一整片冰的胸甲。子彈打在正面會彈開。背後還是肉。"

msgid "Never from the front. Lure it past you, then hit the back."
msgstr "絕對不要從正面打。引它從你旁邊經過，再打它的背。"

msgid "From the LANTERN recordings, reel 9 of 9"
msgstr "出自燈籠站錄音帶　第 9 捲／共 9 捲"

msgid "78°N  -  120 km from the nearest settlement"
msgstr "北緯 78 度——距離最近的聚落 120 公里"

msgid "SHEN RUONING"
msgstr "沈若寧"

msgid "Supply pilot - run 17"
msgstr "補給飛行員——第 17 趟"

msgid "DR. INA KOVAC"
msgstr "伊娜・柯瓦奇 博士"

msgid "Microbiologist - mainland relay"
msgstr "微生物學家——本土中繼站"

msgid "Infected polar bear"
msgstr "被感染的北極熊"

msgid "Drill Shaft - 400 m below the station"
msgstr "鑽探井——研究站地下 400 公尺"

msgid "THE GATEKEEPERS"
msgstr "守門派"

msgid "Quiet Accord containment unit"
msgstr "靜默協定・隔離部隊"

msgid "CPL. KENJI SATO"
msgstr "佐藤健二 下士"

msgid "LANTERN radio operator - 1962"
msgstr "燈籠站無線電操作員——1962"

msgid "Shaft Bottom - 400 m"
msgstr "井底——400 公尺"

msgid "What was waiting under the ice"
msgstr "在冰層底下等待的東西"

msgid "Forty thousand years under the ice. And the whole time, it's been singing."
msgstr "在冰底下四萬年。這段時間裡，它一直在唱歌。"

msgid "Same pitch as the reel. Same pitch as the city."
msgstr "和那捲錄音帶同一個音高。和那座城市同一個音高。"

msgid "Then let's end the song."
msgstr "那就讓這首歌結束吧。"

msgid "The Boreal Star"
msgstr "北極星號"

msgid "The cruise ship is frozen in the ice past the North Harbor pier. Find the Ark manifest in the cargo hold - and deal with whoever holds the sun deck."
msgstr "郵輪卡在北港棧橋外的浮冰裡。到貨艙找到方舟的貨物清單——還有，解決佔據頂層甲板的人。"

msgid "KOVAC: \"There's a cruise ship stuck in the ice north of the harbor - the Boreal Star. It vanished eighteen months ago. If the Ark used it, the manifest will say for what. Get it.\""
msgstr "柯瓦奇：「港口北邊的冰裡卡著一艘郵輪——北極星號。它十八個月前失蹤了。如果方舟用過它，貨物清單會寫用來做什麼。拿到它。」"

msgid "MV Boreal Star - Promenade Deck"
msgstr "北極星號——散步甲板"

msgid "MV Boreal Star - Grand Atrium"
msgstr "北極星號——大中庭"

msgid "CAPTAIN'S LOG, MV BOREAL STAR: \"Day 41 in the ice. The Ark doctors say the 'patients' must not be moved. Passengers confined to cabins. The singing from the theatre started again at midnight.\""
msgstr "船長日誌，北極星號：「困在冰裡第 41 天。方舟的醫生說『病人』不能移動。乘客一律關在客艙。午夜時，劇院裡的歌聲又開始了。」"

msgid "NOTE ON THE PIANO: \"They held a concert for the sick ones. The sick ones sang back. Nobody clapped.\""
msgstr "鋼琴上的紙條：「他們替生病的人辦了一場音樂會。生病的人唱回來了。沒有人鼓掌。」"

msgid "MV Boreal Star - Cargo Hold"
msgstr "北極星號——貨艙"

msgid "ARK MANIFEST, BOREAL STAR: \"Cargo: 212 passengers (sedated), 38 crew, 6 crates of core ice. Destination: none. The ship IS the destination. Keep it cold. Keep them listening.\""
msgstr "方舟貨物清單，北極星號：「貨物：乘客 212 名（已鎮靜）、船員 38 名、核心冰 6 箱。目的地：無。這艘船本身就是目的地。保持低溫。讓他們一直聽。」"

msgid "MV Boreal Star - Sun Deck"
msgstr "北極星號——頂層甲板"

msgid "THE WARDEN"
msgstr "典獄長"

msgid "MV Boreal Star - frozen in the pack ice off North Harbor"
msgstr "北極星號——卡在北港外的浮冰裡"

msgid "Expedition cruise ship  -  missing since March 2025"
msgstr "極地探險郵輪　——　2025 年 3 月失蹤"

msgid "A cruise ship. Ten decks, a thousand windows - and not one of them lit."
msgstr "一艘郵輪。十層甲板、上千扇窗——沒有一扇亮著。"

msgid "Deck, Bridge. The Warden wants the gangway watched. Nothing comes aboard. Nothing leaves."
msgstr "甲板，這裡是艦橋。典獄長要你們盯住棧橋。誰都不准上船。誰都不准離開。"

msgid "The Warden. Somebody up top who likes the high ground."
msgstr "典獄長。上面有個喜歡佔高處的人。"

msgid "A chandelier. A grand piano. A staircase built for wedding photos."
msgstr "水晶吊燈。三角鋼琴。一座專門拍婚紗照用的樓梯。"

msgid "And from the theatre, through the wall... a choir. Rehearsing."
msgstr "還有，隔著牆從劇院傳來的……合唱。在排練。"

msgid "Sun Deck"
msgstr "頂層甲板"

msgid "Gate Two commander - sniper"
msgstr "守門二號指揮官——狙擊手"

msgid "[WARDEN]"
msgstr "[典獄長]"

msgid "Supply pilot. I counted your steps from the gangway. Forty-one. You favour the left leg."
msgstr "補給飛行員。我從棧橋開始數妳的腳步。四十一步。妳比較偏左腳。"

msgid "Stay down in the snow. It's quieter for both of us."
msgstr "待在雪地裡別動。這樣對我們兩個都比較安靜。"

msgid "When that laser turns bright, I'm already dead. Stay behind cover - and make him reload."
msgstr "那道雷射變亮的時候，我就已經死了。躲在掩護後面——逼他拉槍機。"

msgid "The Warden"
msgstr "典獄長"

msgid "Gate Two's commander. A hunter before the Accord found him. He holds the Boreal Star's sun deck from three perches and never wastes a round - unless you give him a reason."
msgstr "守門二號的指揮官。加入協定之前是個獵人。他從三個制高點守著北極星號的頂層甲板，從不浪費一發子彈——除非你給他理由。"

msgid "Break line of sight when the laser thickens. He has to work the bolt after every shot. Noise draws his aim."
msgstr "雷射變粗的時候就躲開他的視線。他每開一槍都要拉槍機。聲音會吸引他的槍口。"

msgid "FRENZY"
msgstr "狂暴"

msgid "LIGHTS OUT"
msgstr "熄燈"

msgid "THE CHOIR ANSWERS"
msgstr "合唱回應了"

msgid "THE SHAFT IS COMING DOWN"
msgstr "井要塌了"

msgid "FLARES UP"
msgstr "照明彈"

msgid "KNIFE"
msgstr "刀"

msgid "RELOAD"
msgstr "裝填"
